note The handler, one call per arrow press. Does nothing while a text field is focused or with no node under the selection (Built::focus_node); otherwise asks toward for the node that way from the focus node, sends Steer(Steering::Keys) so the focus change that follows glides the camera and keeps the root, then selects the node: its step when it is a step of the drawn tour, else its symbol through go_to_symbol; then it marks the move a walk (Model::walked). Each walk that changes the node is its own history place.

