file crates/gui/src/graph/input.rs
symbol toward
lines 0 14
hash d03aecc9dd8debaa
note Picks the node that way. Each node is anchored at a point four cells into its header, half a row down, in this frame's cell size; among the candidates with a positive score from Heading::along the lowest wins. The tree neighbours are tried first, so Right from a parent lands on its first child and Down within a sibling box on the next sibling; only when none lies that way does it search every node.

